<title>INDIA: India RBI sets repo cut-off at 4.15 pct.</title>
<headline>India RBI sets repo cut-off at 4.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it set a cut-off of 4.15 percent at its three-day repo auction.</p>
<p>The cut-off was unchanged from the earlier auction on June 12. RBI said it accepted all five bids for a total amount of 11 billion rupees.  </p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 4.0773 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
